  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="section-label">What MaxSold needed</div>
    <h2 id="maxsold-engagement-title">More estate referrals and more auctioneers listing online.</h2>
    <p class="cs2-intro">MaxSold helps families and businesses sell items through online auctions, including during estate clear-outs and downsizing. It wanted to reach professionals who could refer families and auction businesses that could list on the platform. <a href="https://maxsold.com/pressroom">About MaxSold’s estate auction business <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    <div class="cs2-signal-grid">
      <article><span>01 · Estate referrals</span><h3>We called estate professionals.</h3><p>We asked estate law firms and trust companies to refer families who needed help selling the contents of a home.</p></article>
      <article><span>02 · Auctioneer recruitment</span><h3>We invited auction businesses to list.</h3><p>We asked auctioneers and auction companies to sign up and list their auctions on MaxSold. <a href="https://maxsold.com/maxsold-seller-portal">See MaxSold’s seller portal guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></article>
