<section aria-labelledby="maxsold-approach-title">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="section-label">How we ran the outreach</div>
    <h2 id="maxsold-approach-title">We ran a separate campaign for each group.</h2>
    <p class="cs2-intro">On referral calls, we discussed when families might need help selling items. On auctioneer calls, we discussed listing auctions online.</p>
